# Nora's computer (design/sandbox-runtime §2): the sbx microVM and computerd.
# A USER unit for the account that ran `sbx login`. Long-running on purpose:
# `nora-computer serve` runs computerd in the foreground of an `sbx exec`, so
# if computerd exits the unit exits and systemd restarts it. The sandbox is
# created detached, so it stays up whether or not this unit is running.
# Install: deploy/computer/README.md.
[Unit]
Description=Nora's computer: computerd, supervised in the detached sbx microVM

[Service]
Type=simple
ExecStart=%h/workspace/nora/deploy/computer/nora-computer serve
Restart=always
RestartSec=5
TimeoutStartSec=300

[Install]
WantedBy=default.target
